;; Mario's tutorial stage (0.5.0; reworked in 0.4.36, src/game/tutorial/mario-1-0.ts): walk, jump the
;; steps; walk, sprint and walk again down the long stretch (a gate at 48 opens once you have);
;; two gaps only a sprinting jump clears (7 and 8 wide); a long runway (84-103, 0.4.45) so the
;; stomp's tip comes before the Goomba's pen; stomp the Goomba, penned by a wall on the pit's side
;; (104) and its gate (117); bump a ? block and grow (gate at 136: the gates are laid by the
;; tutorial, not here); take the pipe (the tall column at 151 keeps you to it); the hidden vine at
;; the foot of the tall wall (165); a wall down from the top of the screen with a one-block gap
;; under it (180-181: big Mario ducks and slides under) into a room whose only way on is up
;; through its brick ceiling (182-185; its right wall, 186, is bricks too: never from the side);
;; three bricks, the middle one hiding a Star (191-193), a crowd of Goombas to run through with it
;; (206-217, out of sight while Mario is at the bricks; gate at 220); the flagpole (226); Bowser
;; after it.
